  "description": "Yeon-Hwa dreams of mingling with a snake every night. She started having that dream on the day she saved a snake that was about to die. Then, Yeon-Hwa is captured by the villagers and offered as a sacrifice to the snake god Mu-Gae. Yeon-Hwa pleads with the snake god, saying she wants to live, but Mu-Gae immediately realizes that she is the Yeon-Hwa who saved him.\n\n *“I want to be with you, Yeon-Hwa. I want to touch you.”* \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: First story of RIDI's Dopamine Danpyeonseon (도파민 단편선) Collection.*",
